 "strings": {
  "Not a single woman in our group actually looks good for her age.": "",
  "My son never talks to me. Instead, he's always \"Chattering.\"": "",
  "My husband's on a business trip, so I'm not pressed for time.": "",
  "I hate being called \"mother.\" Why not just call me \"mom\"?": "",
  "This city's bright as day, even late at night.": "",
  "My son taught me how to Chatter.": "",
  "Oh dear. I seem to have misplaced my glasses.": "",
  "Lightly tart cheesecake's nice, but I prefer traditional sweets.": "",
  "It's getting pretty late... Hope he isn't too worried.": "",
  "All these flashing lights and loud noises make me dizzy.": "",
  "So much trash around here. Does anyone ever pick it up?": "",
  "That murder on the news... It happened here in this city.": "",
  "I got separated from my son... What should I do...?": "",
  "I remember needing to buy something...": "",
  "Children make the cutest faces when asking for an allowance.": "",
  "My granddaughter loves this pop idol from 2015.": "",
  "I'm always forgetting <font_kind=yakuza_italic>something</font_kind>. I wasn't always like this...": "",
  "My husband served me coffee, but there was a fish in the percolator!": "",
  "We're blessed to have so many entertainment options here.": "",
  "Haven't been out this late in a while.": "",
  "I've never had a love confession. Our marriage was arranged, you see.": "",
  "Phones these days are so useful. Why, my grandson sent me a photo!": "",
  "What do you suppose a \"Paradise VR\" is for? Getting a massage?": "",
  "What? You got a divorce!? Goodness, I had no idea...": "",
  "Well, I'm out. Too rich for my blood...": "",
  "Lady's got a real nice caboose. Hope Ass Catchem don't find her.": "",
  "Now <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that's</font_kind> a badonkadonk!": "",
  "Wish I had the balls to talk to her.": "",
  "What was her name again? The legendary gambler lady?": "",
  "There's a fishing pool up there? Hope it doesn't leak.": "",
  "Gotta admit, it's pretty dicey down in our world.": "",
  "Gonna win big today!": "",
  "Bet you anything this place will get raided by the cops.": "",
  "Is Mari not here today?": "",
  "Today's just not my day...": "",
  "Maybe I should start fresh at another table.": "",
  "Aww, I was so close...": "",
  "It's almost time for work, but I can't go like this...": "",
  "I wish this place was a little bit bigger...": "",
  "I won with only a pair! Luck's on my side today!": "",
  "A guy clenching a weird amulet got a blackjack...": "",
  "I wonder if that painting was done by someone famous.": "",
  "I must say, the L'Amant Blend is quite refreshing.": "",
  "It'd be nice if they had a wider drink selection.": "",
  "Bet the feds would love to confiscate these extracts.": "",
  "I'll know if you're cheatin'.": "",
  "Can't believe this shit...": "",
  "There's a lady at L'Amant that could kick all your asses.": "",
  "Iyama-san hasn't said much about his past.": "",
  "These extracts sure pack a punch.": "",
  "My wife doesn't know I gamble, and I prefer to keep it that way.": "",
  "Fudge! Why do I keep losing!?": "",
  "Bet this place'll collapse with the slightest quake.": "",
  "Hoo, I am on <font_kind=yakuza_italic>fire</font_kind> today!": "",
  "Returning to reality is always the hardest part.": "",
  "Koro-nyan is cute, but he totally sounds like a hick.": "",
  "Is Koro-nyan self-aware? That'd be intense.": "",
  "How's this all work?": "",
  "Ugh... Motion sickness...": "",
  "What's so paradise-like about a noisy virtual city?": "",
  "What's even real anymore? I stopped being able to tell.": "",
  "Even getting punched in VR feels good.": "",
  "Why are there no sexy VR games? This <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> Kamurocho, isn't it!?": "",
  "There was a goddamn samurai in there!": "",
  "Why does Koro-nyan speak in a Hiroshima dialect?": "",
  "Geez, how am I supposed to beat a tiger!?": "",
  "Got too careless with the dice...": "",
  "A sinister-looking Koro-nyan nabbed all my items!": "",
  "I want the receptionist's shirt.": "",
  "Kamurocho feels so different in VR...": "",
  "I want my own little Koro-nyan pet.": "",
  "Oh no! I'm out of Play Passes!": "",
  "Koro-nyan looks super cuddly.": "",
  "Why is it Dice <font_kind=yakuza_italic>and</font_kind> Cube? Are dice not also cubes?": "",
  "Even I don't feel like eating down here.": "",
  "Think there's any dead bodies floating down there?": "",
  "Stench? What stench? Guess I'm used to it.": "",
  "You need a bathroom? Pick a corner!": "",
  "Ugh. Smells like old crotch down here.": "",
  "Who'd want a surgery down here?": "",
  "Heard the world above has pretty much gone to shit.": "",
  "Down here, it's always sewer o'clock. Y'know?": "",
  "*yawn* Nap time...": "",
  "A really nice bento floated by. Hope it's edible.": "",
  "Oh, so <font_kind=yakuza_italic>I'm</font_kind> the wareme...": "",
  "Oh no, they called ron!": "",
  "Why even play if you're gonna finish with such a cheap hand?": "",
  "Yurika-chan... You're adorable...": "",
  "What is the \"Wear Me\" thing?": "",
  "An open riichi's my best bet.": "",
  "Ergh, what a crappy hand.": "",
  "Awesome! Just what I needed!": "",
  "Is this... a sacred discard?": "",
  "So wareme's high-stakes, huh? Whoever invented this was high.": "",
  "Time to bring the house down!": "",
  "Has Yurika even played mahjong?": "",
  "I swear, these horndogs only come for Yurika-chan.": "",
  "Wareme wets me with excitement!": "",
  "Can't call riichi...": "",
  "There's a red dragon out.": "",
  "Are the tables red for good luck?": "",
  "Aww! I was the wareme last turn!": "",
  "Hah! Suck it! I got 3 ura doras!": "",
  "All these doras and I can't get a single one...": "",
  "Dragon's Palace, huh? Sure is a sausage fest in here.": "",
  "They call this the Dragon's Palace... Why? I don't see no dragon.": "",
  "Wonder who pays the electricity?": "",
  "Why can I not win...?": "",
  "Gonna take my earnings straight to Honmaruen.": "",
  "N-Next time for sure...": "",
  "Can't believe I blew my wife's secret savings.": "",
  "Luck is on my side today!": "",
  "I'm always generous with money. Too bad I never have any...": "",
  "How long's that old guy been living on the 4th floor?": "",
  "It's been 5 years since I said \"fuck it\" to life.": "",
  "Haven't seen old Goto ever since he took off on a raft.": "",
  "Too bad there's no fish to catch down here.": "",
  "Feels like I lived in an apartment ages ago.": "",
  "Shimura cooked us some mystery meat.": "",
  "Heard Moroboshi-sensei took out a guy's colon.": "",
  "Muroi doesn't have a mustache. That's just his nose hair.": "",
  "Have some sewer cheese. Made the milk myself.": "",
  "Saw Muroi talking to a bird. Thought it was his late wife.": "",
  "Dumpster diving is an art. It requires real talent.": "",
  "It was a white crow flying above Tenkaichi Street!": "",
  "This barker I met at the smoking area really knew his stuff!": "",
  "And the new guy asks if dinner was on the clock! Ha!": "",
  "Saw the engagement ring I gave my wife in a pawn shop.": "",
  "Riho says she wants to try out some newfangled \"cat café.\"": "",
  "My grandson works at Turtle Financing on Tenkaichi Street.": "",
  "I want to go to a cat café! There's one on Senryo Avenue!": "",
  "That asshole I used to date gave me a fake ring. So I pawned it.": "",
  "Nyan Nyan Café really helps a girl wind down.": "",
  "Why does mahjong always make me crave curry?": "",
  "The next tile will be... west! ...Nope, I was wrong.": "",
  "Shoot, I should've aimed for a higher tile...": "",
  "I just keep discarding the wrong tiles today...": "",
  "I feel like I'm gonna win today.": "",
  "Ugh... I'll get a ron today if it's the last thing I do!": "",
  "What!? How am I so unlucky!?": "",
  "Wait, I won? Well, whatever!": "",
  "You got a tsumo with <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> wait!?": "",
  "I got carried away and now I might lose...": "",
  "Wait, why'd you go again? You should quit while you're ahead.": "",
  "You can't win at mahjong if you aren't willing to take risks!": "",
  "Hang in there, South! Dealer isn't going to change.": "",
  "Hey, you're good at discarding safe tiles.": "",
  "I'm heading home after this game...": "",
  "Anything I discard might help someone else...": "",
  "Oh. That's ron.": "",
  "Quit reading manga and make your move.": "",
  "You keep asking me to play, but I've never seen you win.": "",
  "My boss loves mahjong, but he sucks, so I have to go easy on him.": "",
  "Move left or right to navigate around obstacles preemptively.\nAvoiding these obstacles beforehand will eliminate the need to press any prompts.": "",
  "Be mindful of where your target is looking. If you enter the target's field of view, their Caution Gauge will rise, so keep your distance and stay out of sight as much as possible.": "",
  "Locate a spot to take cover when the target turns around. If there is a hiding place nearby, you can take cover there by pressing <symbol=button_maru>. There is no risk of getting spotted by the target while hiding for cover.": "",
  "Be careful not to get too close to your target. Your risk of being spotted increases substantially if you get too close, so make sure to keep a proper distance.": "",
  "You can perform various EX Actions as the EX Gauge charges up.\nEX Actions deal an incredible amount of damage, and come in handy when you're in a pinch.": "",
  "Use recovery items whenever your health starts running low.\nYou can use items by either setting them as your shortcuts or navigating through the Items App.": "",
  "If you want to improve your skills, go to the Pause Menu and open up the Skills App.\nPowering up your skills will help you defeat powerful enemies.\nNote that learning new skills requires SP.": "",
  "Find the bomb hidden somewhere in the city before the timer runs out.\nThe bomber gave you a hint that should be at least somewhat related to a location in town.": "",
  "Complete the objectives before the time limit reaches 0.\nIf you can't find the required object, it might be hiding behind something.\nTry looking from a different angle to change up your perspective.": "",
  "Make sure you review the objectives before taking your picture, and be careful to avoid drawing your target's attention.": "",
  "Your target might notice you if you get too close to them or move into their line of sight.\nKeep your distance from the target and wait for the right moment to get that perfect shot.": "",
  "Take a picture that satisfies all the objectives on the right side of the screen.\nYou can raise your camera long before all of them will be checked, so wait until the opportunity is right!": "",
  "Take your picture at just the right moment in order to satisfy all the objectives.\nThese objectives will be displayed on the right side of the screen.\nMake sure all the objectives are checked off before you take the shot.": "",
  "\"CAUTION\" will display onscreen whenever an enemy targets your drone.\nQuickly maneuver your drone to avoid incoming attacks whenever you see this appear.": "",
  "Successfully pick the lock within the time limit. Lifting a pin too high may reset all the work you've done so far, so be sure to move the pins delicately.": "",
  "Matsugane is more frail than you. Prioritize helping him, especially if he gets surrounded.": "",
  "When battles are timed, you've got to make the most of your damage. Remember that the Tiger Style has single, high-powered attacks, while the Crane Style can deal with large enemy groups effectively. Moreover, EX Actions pause the timer, so use them liberally.": "",
  "Mafuyu isn't used to combat and will go down quickly. Prioritize helping her, especially when she's surrounded.": "",
  "Let your EX Gauge charge. EX Actions deal an incredible amount of damage and can be valuable in a pinch.": "",
  "Use a recovery item when your health runs low. You can set them to a shortcut or navigate to them through the Items app.": "",
  "Improve your skills through the Skills App by using SP. This should help give you an edge in battle.": "",
  "The Tiger Style is better suited to single, powerful foes. Unlike Crane, it can not only break enemy guards, but also makes you less likely to falter when blocked. It also contains some of your most powerful skills.": "",
  "The Tiger Style is better suited to single, powerful foes. To avoid Deadly Attacks, note that the enemy will be enveloped with an intense aura, and use wall kicks or EX Boosts to maximize your effectiveness against them.": "",
